{"id":138725380,"slug":"i-explained-the-pandemic-to-myself","title":"I Explained The Pandemic to Myself: Episode 1","subtitle":"Podcasts from days past...","post_date":"2023-11-09T12:29:33.281Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-explained-the-pandemic-to-myself","wordcount":153,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:56:11.759Z","body_sha256":"3bdf7e65115d12ce67ca98f45c4252331925d7e96a6d67e2294548666d1b59bc","text_words":163,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>In the pandemic, I didn’t know what to do with myself.  One of the things I did to make sense of my world falling apart was to make a podcast.  I think the questions I asked at the time hold up well enough.  This is the first episode I made, just about a week into lockdown in New York City. I  recorded the audio on March 13th and released it on March 15th, 2020.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6QI7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f282282-85f7-490e-8bc2-6e2a4da7c992_1400x1400.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6QI7!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f282282-85f7-490e-8bc2-6e2a4da7c992_1400x1400.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6QI7!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f282282-85f7-490e-8bc2-6e2a4da7c992_1400x1400.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6QI7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f282282-85f7-490e-8bc2-